450 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Hosting \046 Technology\n\nCB Works will host the client\031s website under the selected hosting package\056\nThe website is hosted through Netlify\054 with website content and media managed through DatoCMS\056 The website code is stored in a GitHub repository\056\nHosting includes the live website environment\054 connection to the CMS\054 uptime monitoring\054 SSL security\054 essential platform maintenance and email\055based support\056 Each package is subject to the bandwidth\054 storage and CMS user limits shown in the handover document or hosting plan\056\n\nThe website may also rely on third\055party services such as domain providers\054 analytics tools\054 forms\054 plugins\054 APIs and embedded media\056 These services are subject to their own pricing\054 limits\054 terms and availability\056\n\nSecurity \046 Access\n\nThe website will be served securely over HTTPS using an SSL certificate provided through the hosting platform\056\n\nCB Works will take reasonable steps to keep the hosting setup secure and maintained\056 However\054 no website or online service can be guaranteed to be completely secure\056\nThe client is responsible for keeping account details and passwords secure\054 limiting access to trusted users\054 removing access when it is no longer required and only sharing access to trusted users\056\n\nCB Works is not responsible for security issues caused by shared or weak passwords\054 unauthorised users or changes made by the client or another provider\056\n\nContent Management\n\nThe client will be given access to a headless CMS to manage website content\056\n\nThe client is responsible for all content uploaded\054 edited or published through the CMS\056 This includes ensuring that content is accurate\054 lawful\054 up to date and does not breach copyright or the rights of another person or business\056\n\nCB Works is not responsible for errors\054 claims\054 copyright issues or other problems caused by content published by the client or its authorised users\056\n\nContent entry\054 copywriting and ongoing content updates are not included unless agreed separately\056\n\nMaintenance \046 Support\n\nHosting includes essential maintenance required to keep the existing website operating on its current platform\056 This may include hosting configuration\054 deployment maintenance\054 minor compatibility updates and assistance with CMS or publishing issues\056\n\nCB Works will aim to acknowledge support requests within one business day\056 Resolution times will depend on the issue and whether a third\055party provider is involved\056\n\nHosting does not include redesigns\054 new pages\054 new functionality\054 major platform upgrades\054 SEO campaigns\054 marketing\054 third\055party subscription fees\054 domain renewals\054 business email support or work required because of changes made by another developer\056\n\nAny work outside the hosting package will be quoted separately and billed at an ad hoc rate\056 \n\nAvailability \046 Third\055Party Outages\n\nThe client understands that the website relies on third\055party services\054 including Netlify\054 DatoCMS\054 domain providers and other external platforms\056\n\nThese services may experience outages\054 maintenance\054 security incidents\054 performance problems or changes to their products\054 pricing and usage limits\056\n\nCB Works will take reasonable steps to investigate website outages and assist with restoring the service\056 However\054 CB Works cannot guarantee that the website will always be available or operate without interruption\056\n\nTo the extent permitted by law\054 CB Works is not responsible for lost sales\054 enquiries\054 income or other business loss caused by third\055party outages\054 internet failures\054 DNS issues\054 expired domains\054 client actions or events outside the reasonable control of CB Works\056 Nothing in these terms removes any rights that cannot legally be excluded\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 451 0 R
     /Pg 444 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

